%N A399452 Total number of dominating sets in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A399452 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399452/b399452.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A399452 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/DominatingSet.html">Dominating Set</a>.
%o A399452 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=w=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t1=x*exp(v), t2=x*exp(u+v)); u=x*exp(u+v+w); v=t2-t1; w=t1); Vec(serlaplace(intformal((u + v)/x)))}
